    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Hooded ninja in indigo wraps with a face mask, layered tabard with woven spiderweb embroidery, red sash, arm and shin bindings, split-toe footwear and a sheathed sword across the back. The 1024px portrait shows individually shaded eyes, fabric weave and the embroidery pattern clearly. Rear views confirm the scabbard, strap buckle and sash knot are complete. Rigged: 24-bone humanoid armature, walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
